# Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind's mana gives haste only to a Dragon creature spell it pays for (CR 106.6), also when the pool
# holds snow mana, which is paid by its qualities (CR 107.4h). On turn 1 the Orb's {R} beside a Snow-Covered Island's {U} pays
# Mons's Goblin Raiders, the only mana that can; on turn 3 it is chosen by name (`Spend:`) beside a Snow-Covered Mountain's {R}
# for a second Raiders. Neither Goblin gains haste, so neither can attack the turn it is cast and Bot2 stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Snow-Covered Island
Black Lotus
Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind
Mons's Goblin Raiders x2
Snow-Covered Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Snow-Covered Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Snow-Covered Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mons's Goblin Raiders.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Snow-Covered Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Snow-Covered Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mons's Goblin Raiders.Cast(Spend: R DragonCreatureSpellsGainHaste)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders#2.Keywords = (absent)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
